\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The proposed earning-roles loop. Orange marks situated observation, green marks responsibility-safe evidence, and blue marks the future decision and its independently scored consequence. The feedback edge is delayed: it can change a later read cut but cannot rewrite a sealed assignment. Each artifact shown in the diagram is a planned ledger field, not a reported result.}}{3}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
